a complete dependency list — see the package.json files and their lockfiles for that.

The GUI is a local cockpit for an AIOS workspace: a web client and server under `gui/`,
plus a Tauri desktop shell under `src-tauri/`. It reads and drives a workspace checkout
on the same machine.


