------------------

Tauri — Apache License 2.0 / MIT (dual)
    https://github.com/tauri-apps/tauri
    The desktop shell. Referenced as a build dependency and not redistributed here in
    modified form. Both arms of its dual license are permissive and compatible with
    distributing this application under the AGPL.

Rust standard library and crates under `src-tauri/` — Apache-2.0 / MIT (dual)
    Resolved by Cargo at build time. All permissive.

Node dependencies of `gui/client` and `gui/server` — predominantly MIT / ISC / BSD
    Permissive and compatible with an AGPL-licensed work. The lockfiles are the
    authoritative record.


